    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Immersive UI\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Immersive UI\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'flex flex-col h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#020408] text-slate-200 font-sans overflow-hidden p-6\'> <header class=\'flex justify-between items-center mb-6 px-4\'> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3\'> <div class=\'w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-tr from-orange-500 via-white to-green-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,165,0,0.3)]\'> <div class=\'w-6 h-6 border-2 border-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-[10px]\'>BB</div> </div> <div> <h1 class=\'text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-none\'>BharatBridge</h1> <p class=\'text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1\'>Unified Indian Language Grid</p> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-6\'> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-white/5 rounded-full border border-white/10\'> <div class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_#22c55e]\'></div> <span class=\'text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\'>STT Pipeline: Active</span> </div> <div class=\'text-right\'> <p class=\'text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase\'>Server Node</p> <p class=\'text-xs font-mono text-orange-400\'>MUM-WEST-042</p> </div> </div> </header> <main class=\'flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 overflow-hidden\'> <section class=\'col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-4\'> <div class=\'bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-5 flex-1 flex flex-col\'> <div class=\'flex justify-between items-center mb-4\'> <h2 class=\'text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest\'>Source Input</h2> <div class=\'flex gap-2\'> <button class=\'px-2 py-1 bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 rounded text-[10px] border border-orange-500/30\'>AUTO DETECT</button> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 mb-4\'> <div class=\'w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center text-xl\'>\340\244\256</div> <div> <p class=\'text-xs text-slate-400\'>Detected Language</p> <p class=\'text-lg font-semibold text-white\'>\340\244\256\340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\240\340\245\200 <span class=\'text-slate-500 font-normal ml-2 text-sm\'>Marathi</span></p> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300 relative\'> <div class=\'absolute top-2 right-2 flex gap-1\'> <span class=\'w-1 h-3 bg-orange-500 rounded-full animate-pulse\'></span> <span class=\'w-1 h-3 bg-orange-500 rounded-full delay-75 animate-pulse\'></span> <span class=\'w-1 h-3 bg-orange-500 rounded-full delay-150 animate-pulse\'></span> </div> \\\"\340\244\206\340\244\234 \340\244\206\340\244\252\340\244\243 \340\244\225\340\245\203\340\244\244\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\256 \340\244\254\340\245\201\340\244\246\340\245\215\340\244\247\340\244\277\340\244\256\340\244\244\340\245\215\340\244\244\340\245\207\340\244\254\340\244\246\340\245\215\340\244\246\340\244\262 \340\244\266\340\244\27