  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Session Logic**\n\nI\'ve begun implementing the core session logic, focusing on the functionality to initiate and participate in live sessions. My immediate next steps involve establishing real-time transcription and translation capabilities, pushing this data to Firestore for persistence. I am confident that my design will be scaleable as it builds on established best-practice technologies, that are well-established for this field.\n\n\n**Refining Session Management**\n\nI\'ve just refined the session management by integrating a listener with `onSnapshot` to actively track and update session messages in real-time. This ensures that the messages are synced as they happen in a session. Before, I was missing this critical piece of the puzzle and had to update my design to fully realize this functionality. This keeps the messages in the frontend app up to date with any updates.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 312033794
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
