  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Confirming Real-Time Bridge**\n\nI\'ve successfully implemented the multi-language real-time translation bridge. I\'ve updated `server.ts` to effectively manage multiple Gemini Live translations.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the core implementation of **Bharat Bridge**, aligning the application with your vision for real-time, multi-regional communication.\n\n### Key Enhancements\n\n*   **Multi-Language Real-Time Engine**: The backend has been completely refactored to support multiple target languages simultaneously. Each unique language requested by listeners triggers its own dedicated Gemini Live translation session.\n*   **Personalized Listener Experience**: Listeners now receive audio and text specifically in their chosen regional language. Whether there are 10 or 1000 listeners, each person hears the speaker in the language they prefer.\n*   **Bharat Bridge Role Portal**: I designed a high-contrast, professional role selection interface.\n    *   **Speaker Mode**: Allows the host to broadcast their voice across the entire \"Bridge.\"\n    *   **Listener Mode**: Allows users to join an event and select their specific \"Output Node\" (Target Language).\n*   **Live Translation Streaming**: Listeners now receive real-time transcriptions via WebSockets, ensuring that even if they join a session with a different language than the host\'s default, they get a personalized live feed.\n*   **Transcript Persistence & Export**:\n    *   The \"official\" session transcript (in the speaker\'s default language) is securely saved to **Firestore**.\n    *   Listeners can **Export** their personalized transcript directly from the UI, capturing the real-time translations they received in their specific language.\n*   **Optimized Broadcasting**: The server now intelligently pipes audio to all active language groups while maintaining a clean feedback loop for the speaker.\n\nThe application now functions as a true \"Unified Indian Language Grid,\" capable of bridging communication gaps across the country in real-time.\n\n**Note**: To start a live event, ensure you are signed in and select your preferred languages in the \"Bharat Bridge\" portal. Listeners can then join using your Session ID."
