 detail; the 404 error stems from improper file path resolution in production mode. I realized using `express.static(distPath)` in the `else` block where it is in production mode, and that my pathing was flawed. I\'m now replacing `path.join(process.cwd(), \"dist\")` with `path.resolve(__dirname, \"dist\")`, where `__dirname` is derived using `fileURLToPath` for robust deployment. I am confident that should resolve this issue.\n\n\n"
