    thinking: "**Analyzing Potential Issues**\n\nI\'ve hit a potential snag. I was reviewing `server.ts` and noticed the `onmessage` callback in `getOrCreateLanguageGroup` relies on the `transcription` variable. However, I\'m unsure about how `transcription` will work with `gemini-3.5-live-translate-preview`, as detailed in the skill. This needs further inspection.\n\n\n**Implementing Transcription Updates**\n\nI\'ve made progress on audio transcription. I\'ve enabled `outputAudioTranscription` and `inputAudioTranscription` in the config. Now, I will handle them in `onmessage`. I realized that transcription could come from different parts depending on whether I\'m using `gemini-3.5-live-translate-preview`, but it seems like `LiveServerMessage` already provides them. I need to verify that mapping.\n\n\n**Resolving the Dist Path**\n\nOkay, I\'ve got it! My focus shifted to the 404 error. The problem was the `distPath` calculation. I realized that using `__dirname` in the built `dist/server.cjs` creates an incorrect path. After looking at this more, I discovered that the correct way to specify it is using `process.cwd()`. I should have it fixed now!\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 369402740
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
